From: =?UTF-8?q?Bernhard=20Rosenkr=C3=A4nzer?= <bero@lindev.ch>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 18:23:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] Bug 2054387 - gfx: Qt platform, GL/EGL, and WebRender
 integration. r?#gfx-reviewers

Add gfxPlatformQt and wire GLContext/EGL, layers, and WebRender
compositors for the Qt widget toolkit (including software and EGL
present paths).

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311738
